{
  "name": "Where should I stay on the Amalfi Coast?",
  "parent_id": 230624347930176,
  "group_id": "bfc6f92d-693c-4c73-bd18-6afb1e43d239",
  "alternates": [],
  "created_at": "2026-10-15T07:20:08.782Z",
  "deleted_at": null,
  "sort_by_date": null,
  "tag_list": [],
  "updated_at": "2026-11-10T20:55:49.537Z",
  "published_at": "2026-11-10T20:55:49.508Z",
  "id": 230847319198399,
  "uuid": "34c9b1d6-f9f0-4400-ada7-7c479f8af063",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "a18bb14f-c025-4d7a-976a-d5cbf179c4ba",
    "answer": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Amalfi is the most central base for buses and ferries. Positano is the most photographed town, but it is steep and full of stairs.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Ravello sits high above the coast and is quiet in the evening.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "question": "Where should I stay?",
    "component": "faq_item",
    "answer__i18n__de": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Amalfi ist der zentralste Standort für Busse und Fähren. Positano ist der am häufigsten fotografierte Ort, aber er ist steil und voller Treppen.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Ravello liegt hoch über der Küste und ist abends ruhig.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "answer__i18n__es": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Amalfi es la base más céntrica para los autobuses y los ferris. Positano es el pueblo más fotografiado, pero es empinado y está lleno de escaleras.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Ravello se alza muy por encima de la costa y por la noche es tranquilo.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "answer__i18n__fr": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Amalfi est la base la plus centrale pour les bus et les ferries. Positano est la ville la plus photographiée, mais elle est escarpée et pleine d'escaliers.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Ravello domine la côte de très haut et reste calme le soir.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "question__i18n__de": "Wo sollte ich übernachten?",
    "question__i18n__es": "¿Dónde debería alojarme?",
    "question__i18n__fr": "Où dois-je séjourner ?"
  },
